## Interface: 16001
## Title: ForeverScribe
## Notes: Read-only character journal for your AI agent: snapshot + event log in SavedVariables. No network, no automation; the only chat read is auction-outcome system lines. /scribe way sets a map pin + arrow; /fs go walks a route your agent wrote. Notes where you meet NPCs.
